hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1830","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne Yajuj aur Majuj ki deewar se is jaisa khola hai, aur Aap ne apne haath se nabbe ka aqad kiya."
"1831","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek lashkar Kaaba par hamla karega, phir jab wo zameen ke chatyal maidan mein honge to un ke awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jayega, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Un ke awwal aur aakhir ko kaise dhansaya jayega jabke un mein un ke bazari log aur jo un mein se nahi wo honge? Aap ne farmaya: Un ke awwal aur aakhir ko dhansaya jayega, phir wo apni niyyaton par uthaye jayenge."
"1832","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina ke qilon mein se ek qile par chadhe aur farmaya: Kya tum dekhte ho jo main dekhta hun? Beshak main fitnon ke utarne ki jaghein tumhare gharon ke darmiyan aise dekhta hun jaise barish ke utarne ki jaghein."
"1833","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Fitne honge, un mein baithne wala khade se behtar hai, aur khada chalne wale se behtar hai, aur chalne wala daudne wale se behtar hai, aur jo un ke liye jhanke wo use kheench lenge, aur jo panah ya bachao paye to use us se panah leni chahiye."
"1834","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakra (raziyallahu anhu) se Ahnaf bin Qais ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main is shakhs ki madad ke liye gaya to mujhe Abu Bakra mile aur kaha: Kahan chahte ho? Main ne kaha: Is shakhs ki madad, unhon ne kaha: Wapas jao, phir beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jab do musalman apni talwaron se milein to qatil aur maqtool Aag mein hain, phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye to qatil hai, phir maqtool ka kya haal? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo apne sathi ke qatl ka harees tha."
"1835","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke do giroh qital karein aur un ke darmiyan badi qatl ho, un dono ka daawa ek hoga."
"1836","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ek khutba diya jis mein Aap ne Qayamat tak koi cheez na chhodi magar zikr ki, use jis ne jana jana aur jis ne na jana na jana, beshak main wo cheez dekhta hun jo main bhool gaya tha phir pehchanta hun jaise shakhs pehchanta hai jab wo us se ghayab ho phir use dekhe aur pehchane."
"1837","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baithe they, phir unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se kaun Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul fitne mein yaad rakhta hai? Main ne kaha: Main, jaise Aap ne kaha, unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum us par jaree ho, main ne kaha: Shakhs ka fitna us ke ghar walon, maal, aulad aur padosi mein hai, use namaz, roza, sadqa, bhalayi ka hukm aur burai se rokna mita deta hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ye nahi chahta lekin wo fitna jo samandar ki tarah maujein marta hai, unhon ne kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Tum par us se koi harj nahi, beshak tumhare aur us ke darmiyan band darwaza hai, unhon ne kaha: Kya wo toda jayega ya khola jayega? Unhon ne kaha: Toda jayega, unhon ne kaha: Phir wo kabhi band na hoga, hum ne kaha: Kya Umar darwaze ko jante they? Unhon ne kaha: Haan jaise ke kal se pehle raat hai, beshak main ne use aisi hadith bayan ki jo aghaleet mein se nahi, phir hum Huzaifa se poochhne se dare aur hum ne Masrooq ko hukm diya aur us ne poocha, phir unhon ne kaha: Darwaza Umar hai."
"1838","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke Furat sone ke khazane se khul jaye, phir jo us par hazir ho wo us mein se kuch na le."
"1839","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke Hijaz ki zameen se aag nikle jo Busra mein oonton ki gardanein roshan kare."
"1840","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko suna jabke Aap mashriq ki taraf munh kiye they, farmate: Khabardar beshak fitna yahan hai, jahan se shaitan ka seeng nikalta hai."
"1841","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke Daus ki aurton ke koolhe Zul Khalasa par harkat karein, aur Zul Khalasa Daus ka but tha jis ki wo jahiliyyat mein ibadat karte they."
"1842","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke shakhs shakhs ki qabr par guzre aur kahe: Kaash main us ki jagah hota."
"1843","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kaaba ko patli pindliyon wala Habsha se girayega."
"1844","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke Qahtan se ek shakhs nikle jo logon ko apni laathi se hankega."
"1845","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tum aisi qaum se ladoge jin ke joote baal honge, aur Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tum aisi qaum se ladoge goya un ke chehre thonki hui dhalon jaisi hain."
"1846","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Logon ko Quraish ka ye qabeela halak karega, unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap hamein kya hukm dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: Kaash log un se alag rahein."
"1847","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kisra halak hua, phir us ke baad Kisra na hoga, aur Qaisar zaroor halak hoga, phir us ke baad Qaisar na hoga, aur un dono ke khazane Allah ki rah mein zaroor taqseem kiye jayenge."
"1848","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Kisra halak ho to us ke baad Kisra nahi, aur jab Qaisar halak ho to us ke baad Qaisar nahi, aur Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai un dono ke khazane Allah ki rah mein zaroor kharch kiye jayenge."
"1849","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Tum Yahud se ladoge aur un par ghalib aaoge, phir pathar kahega: Ae musalman! Ye Yahudi mere peeche hai, phir use qatal kar."
"1850","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tees ke qareeb jhoote Dajjal bheje jayenge, un sab ka gumaan hoga ke wo Allah ke Rasool hain."
"1851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Umar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ke ek giroh mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Ibn Sayyad ki taraf chale, yahan tak ke use larkon ke sath khelta paya Banu Maghala ke qile ke paas, aur Ibn Sayyad us din ehtelam ke qareeb tha, phir use khabar na hui yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne haath se us ki peeth par mara, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hun? To Ibn Sayyad ne Aap ki taraf dekha aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum ummiyon ke Rasool ho, phir Ibn Sayyad ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka rasool hun? To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Main Allah aur Us ke Rasoolon par iman laya, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum kya dekhte ho? Ibn Sayyad ne kaha: Mere paas sacha aur jhoota aata hai, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum par mamla khalt malt ho gaya hai, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhare liye ek posheeda baat chhupayi hai, Ibn Sayyad ne kaha: Wo dhuan hai, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Door ho, tum apni qadar se aage na badhoge, Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe us mein ijazat dijiye ke main us ki gardan maar dun, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar wo wahi ho to tum us par musallat na hoge, aur agar wo wahi na ho to tumhe us ke qatl mein koi bhalayi nahi."
"1852","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Ubayy bin Kaab chale ke us khajoor ke bagh mein jayein jismein Ibn Sayyad tha, yahan tak ke jab wo bagh mein dakhil hue to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khajoor ke tanon se bachne lage, jabke Aap Ibn Sayyad ko dhoka de rahe they ke Ibn Sayyad se pehle kuch sun lein ke wo Aap ko dekhe, aur Ibn Sayyad apne bistar par leta hua tha, apni qateefa mein jismein sarsarahat thi, phir Ibn Sayyad ki walida ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha jabke Aap khajoor ke tanon se bach rahe they, phir us ne Ibn Sayyad se kaha: Ae Saaf [aur wo us ka naam hai], phir Ibn Sayyad uth khada hua, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar wo use chhod deti to wazeh ho jata."
"1853","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein khade hue aur Allah ki sana ki jis ka Wo ehel hai, phir Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Beshak main tumhe us se dara raha hun, aur koi Nabi nahi magar us ne apni qaum ko us se daraya, beshak Nuh ne apni qaum ko us se daraya, lekin main tumhe us ke bare mein ek qaul kahunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum se na kaha, tum jante ho ke wo kana hai, aur Allah kana nahi hai."
"1854","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek din logon ke samne Masih Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Beshak Allah kana nahi hai, khabardar beshak Masih Dajjal dayan aankh se kana hai, goya us ki aankh ubhri angur hai."
"1855","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi Nabi mab'oos nahi hua magar us ne apni ummat ko kane jhoote se daraya, khabardar beshak wo kana hai, aur beshak tumhara Rab kana nahi hai, aur beshak us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hoga."
"1856","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Uqba bin Amr ne Huzaifa se kaha: Kya tum hamein wo bayan na karoge jo tum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Beshak Dajjal ke sath jab wo nikle pani aur aag hogi, raha jo log dekhte hain ke wo aag hai to thanda pani hai, aur raha jo log dekhte hain ke wo thanda pani hai to jalane wali aag hai, phir tum mein se jo use paye to use chahiye ke us mein gire jise wo aag samajhta hai, phir beshak wo meetha thanda hai."
"1857","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhe Dajjal ke bare mein hadith na sunayun jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum se na kahi? Beshak wo kana hai, aur beshak wo Jannat aur Aag ki misaal lekar aayega, phir wo jise wo kehta hai ke Jannat hai wo Aag hai, aur beshak main tumhe dara raha hun jaise Nuh ne apni qaum ko us se daraya."
"1858","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Dajjal ke bare mein lambi hadith bayan ki, phir us mein se jo Aap ne hamein bayan kiya tha ye tha ke farmaya: Dajjal aayega jabke us par Madina ke raston mein dakhil hona haram hai, Madina ki kuch khari zameen mein, phir us din us ki taraf ek shakhs niklega jo logon mein sab se behtar hai ya behtareen logon mein se hai, phir Dajjal kahega: Kya tum dekhte ho agar main ise qatal karun phir zinda karun to kya tum mamle mein shak karoge? To wo kahenge: Nahi, phir wo use qatal karega phir zinda karega, phir wo kahega jab use zinda karega: Allah ki qasam main aaj se zyada baseerat wala kabhi na tha, phir Dajjal kahega: Main use qatal karunga, phir wo us par musallat na hoga."
"1859","[AI-translation] Hazrat al-Mughira bin Shoba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Dajjal ke bare mein kisi ne itna sawal na kiya jitna main ne sawal kiya, aur Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Wo tumhe kya nuqsan dega? Main ne kaha: Kyunke wo kehte hain ke us ke sath roti ka pahad aur pani ki neher hai, Aap ne farmaya: Wo Allah par is se aasan hai."
"1860","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Koi sheher nahi magar Dajjal use rondega, siwaye Makkah aur Madina ke, us ke raston mein koi rasta nahi magar us par farishte saf bandhe un ki hifazat karte hain, phir Madina apne rehne walon se teen martaba kanpega, phir Allah har kafir aur munafiq ko nikalega."
"1861","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Logon mein sab se bure wo hain jinhe Qayamat pa legi jabke wo zinda hain."
"1862","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Saad (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha, Aap ne apni do ungliyon se aise kaha, darmiyani aur anguthe se agli ungli se: Main aur Qayamat in dono ki tarah bheja gaya hun."
"1863","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main aur Qayamat in dono ki tarah bheje gaye hain."
"1864","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do phoonkon ke darmiyan chalees hai, unhon ne kaha: Chalees din? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne inkar kiya, unhon ne kaha: Chalees mahine? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne inkar kiya, unhon ne kaha: Chalees saal? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne inkar kiya, unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah aasman se pani nazil karega aur wo ugenge jaise sabzi ugti hai, insan mein se koi cheez nahi magar gal jayegi siwaye ek haddi ke, aur wo dumchi ki haddi hai, aur usi se Qayamat ke din paidaish jodi jayegi."
"1865","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mayyat ke peeche teen chalte hain, phir do wapas aate hain aur ek us ke sath rehta hai, us ke peeche us ke ghar wale, maal aur amal chalte hain, phir us ke ghar wale aur maal wapas aate hain aur us ka amal rehta hai."
